<title>USA: PREMIS secondary offer grosses $8.7 mln.</title>
<headline>PREMIS secondary offer grosses $8.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>PREMIS Corp, which markets a line of information management software systems, said its 1,750,000 share secondary offer generated gross proceeds of about $8.7 million.</p>
<p>It said the offering provides funds to complete the acquisition of REF Retail Systems Corp of Toronto, which was announced July 10.</p>
<p>Until recently, REF had specialized in retail point of sale software, while PREMIS specialized in company headquarters business.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
